Here's an example of how to perform these operations using Python and the pandas library:

```python
import pandas as pd

# Assuming df is your DataFrame
df['Departure Time'] = pd.to_datetime(df['act_dep_time'], format='%I:%M %p')
df['Departure Hour'] = df['Departure Time'].dt.hour

# Group by Departure Hour and count the number of delayed departures
delayed_departures = df[df['arr_dep_delay'] > 0].groupby('Departure Hour').size()

# Plot the results using a bar chart or line graph
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
plt.bar(delayed_departures.index, delayed_departures.values)
plt.xlabel('Hour of the Day')
plt.ylabel('Number of Delayed Departures')
plt.title('Trend of Delayed Departures by Hour of the Day')
plt.show()
```
